y 3 tbsp fixed} each and set them on the lined sheets with a {len 2 in} gap between them, about 12 per sheet.","uses":[]},{"text":"Bake one sheet at a time until the edges are golden but the centers still look pale and a little soft, {time 10-12 min}. The centers firm up as the cookies cool.","uses":[]},{"text":"Let the cookies cool on the sheet for {time 5 min}, then move them to a wire rack. Bake the remaining dough on a cool sheet; a hot sheet makes the cookies spread too much.","uses":[]}]}